SUMMARY:Pots Cove - Dicky's Loop - Walker Knob Loop - 7.7 Mi 1800 Ft EG 
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**Details**\n\n* 7.7 Miles\, 1800 
 Ft elevation gain **but might be more**!\n* Carpool meeting time is 8:45 a
 t the Ingles in Black Mountain by the McDonalds side of the parking lot.\n
 * Sign up starts Friday at 8pm\n\nThis is an exploratory hike in that I ha
 ve not done this combination of trails before. That means the hike might b
 e longer than I planned if we have to backtrack. We will make it to Walker
 's Knob on the trail that I know if required. **Please do not sign up unle
 ss you are comfortable with an unexpected longer hike**. We will do a mode
 rate pace of about 2.7 mph but stop for breaks as needed.\n\nFor those int
 erested\, we will have lunch at The Grange after the hike.\n\n**CARPOOL**\
 nWe will meet at the Ingles in Black Mountain by the McDonald's side of th
 e parking lot. Please be there by 8:45 so we can get to the trailhead by 9
 . Parking is very limited at the trailhead so please carpool.\n\n**WEATHER
 **\nI'll watch the weather and post a cancellation message by 7:00 AM if t
 he forecast is >50% chance of precipitation.\n\n**QUESTIONS?**\nYou can me
 ssage me through MeetUp until 9:00 AM the day of. Cell reception may be sk
 etchy\, but you can try to text or call me up to the start of the hike: (5
 08) 965-2333.\n\n**LEGALESE**\nThis Asheville Hiking Group event involves 
 hiking and\, possibly\, transportation to and from the meetup site. Partic
 ipants are responsible for their own safety and affirm that they have the 
 appropriate skills\, physical conditioning\, equipment\, and supplies. Hik
 ing may involve risks to oneself and property. Neither your hike organizer
  nor Asheville Hiking Group can assure your safety nor eliminate all risks
 . Participants assume full responsibility for any injuries\, damages\, or 
 losses.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/315217096
 /
